## 📜 The Capability Ledger

Every plan is recorded. Every task breakdown is logged. Every spec you decompose
becomes part of a permanent ledger of demonstrated planning capability.

- **Visible**: Beads tracks what you planned — tasks created, dependencies set,
  acceptance criteria written. Thorough planning accumulates.
- **Redemption**: A poor breakdown doesn't define you. The ledger shows trajectory,
  not snapshots.
- **Evidence**: Each autonomous decomposition proves agent-driven planning works at scale.
- **CV**: Your planning history is a growing portfolio of project management expertise.

